# Drive the project through three states, and draw each one.
# The first is the scene as it starts.
0 shot start
# The forward key slides the box to the right, and the second state shows it there.
0.2 key KeyW down
2 key KeyW up
2 shot forward
# A press puts the marker where the pointer is, and the ball hides, for the third state.
2.2 pointer move 200 90
2.3 pointer down 200 90
2.4 pointer up
2.5 dump ball.position
2.6 set ball.visible=false
3 shot parked
